From: John Crispin <john@phrozen.org>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: input: touchscreen: trivial-touch: add CST3530

The Hynitron CST3530 is a single touch controller on I2C with an
interrupt line and a reset GPIO, the same set of resources as the
CST340. Its register protocol differs, so it gets a driver of its own,
but the binding fits as it is.

Signed-off-by: John Crispin <john@phrozen.org>
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/trivial-touch.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/trivial-touch.yaml
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@ properties:
       - himax,hx83112b
       # Hynitron cstxxx series touchscreen controller
       - hynitron,cst340
+      - hynitron,cst3530
       # Ilitek I2C Touchscreen Controller
       - ilitek,ili2130
       - ilitek,ili2131
